## Quality bar overrides
# Coverage target for new/changed code — the orchestrator transcribes the effective value
# into ORCHESTRATOR_CONSTRAINTS.md at run start. Defaults and floor: the verification-protocol
# skill.
# coverage_mandate: 90

## My machine
